---
title: "C26 — Publication identity and retry · Implemented"
---
sequenceDiagram
  participant P as Serialized publisher
  participant G as Git history and releases
  participant R as Image registry
  P->>G: Validate committed source and prior app identity
  P->>R: Build or verify immutable app image
  R-->>P: Digest and matching source/version labels
  P->>G: Ensure application Git tag
  P->>G: Create or resume draft release
  P->>G: Upload matching release.json
  P->>G: Publish release
  alt Interrupted attempt
    P->>G: Retry the same source and version
    P->>R: Verify matching existing image
    P->>G: Resume incomplete publication
  else Conflicting identity
    P-->>P: Fail without overwriting tags or manifests
  end
